My bus is coming.
I board the bus.
The bus is very crowded today.
Many people are standing on the bus.
I look for a seat for myself.
I find an empty seat near the window.
I sit there.
I am looking outside through the window.
The morning traffic is very heavy.
Many vehicles are moving on the road.
The bus is moving very slowly.
The conductor is coming to me.
"Ticket, madam," he says.
"Bhaiya, one ticket," I say.
I say the name of the office stop.
"Fifteen rupees," he says.
I am taking out money from my bag.
I give him the money.
He is giving me the ticket.
I put my ticket in the bag.
I am going to my office comfortably.
